---
import "@fontsource-variable/bricolage-grotesque";
import "@fontsource-variable/instrument-sans";
import "@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/400.css";
import "@fontsource/ibm-plex-mono/500.css";
import "../styles/tokens.css";
import "../styles/base.css";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Full-stack engineer (5+ yrs) shipping TypeScript platforms, .NET desktop apps and production AI features."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#F2F1EC" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <title>Khalil Ben Ali — Full-Stack &amp; AI Engineer</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip-link resume-skip" href="#resume">Skip to résumé</a>

    <main class="resume-shell">
      <nav class="resume-actions" aria-label="Résumé actions">
        <a class="back-link" href="/">Back to portfolio</a>
        <a class="download-link" href="/KhalilBenAli-CV.pdf" download>
          Download PDF
        </a>
      </nav>

      <article class="resume-sheet" id="resume" aria-labelledby="resume-name">
        <header class="resume-header">
          <div class="identity-line">
            <h1 id="resume-name">KHALIL BEN ALI</h1>
            <p class="role">— Full-Stack &amp; AI Engineer</p>
          </div>
          <p class="contact-line">
            Faenza, Italy ·
            <a href="mailto:khalil.benali16121@gmail.com"
              >khalil.benali16121@gmail.com</a
            >
            · <a href="https://github.com/khalilBenAli1">github.com/khalilBenAli1</a>
            ·
            <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/khalil-ben-ali"
              >linkedin.com/in/khalil-ben-ali</a
            >
          </p>
        </header>

        <div class="resume-body">
          <div class="resume-main">
            <section class="summary-section" aria-labelledby="summary-title">
              <h2 id="summary-title">SUMMARY</h2>
              <p>
                Full-stack engineer (5+ years) shipping TypeScript platforms, .NET
                desktop apps and production AI. Primary engineer of an AI
                operations hub integrating 10 SaaS systems for a US financial
                firm; sole developer of an AI brand experience for JDE's L'OR.
                Owns systems end to end — schema to WebGL, prompt to print queue.
              </p>
            </section>

            <section class="experience-section" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
              <h2 id="experience-title">EXPERIENCE</h2>

              <div class="role-entry">
                <h3>
                  <strong>nBold</strong> — Full-Stack &amp; AI Engineer · 2024 →
                  present · remote (Paris HQ)
                </h3>
                <p class="role-context">
                  nBold builds Microsoft Teams workspace-templating &amp; governance
                  SaaS (ISO 27001, SOC 2).
                </p>
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    Designed and built the platform's Teams meeting-intelligence
                    feature end to end (~11,000 lines, 67 files, 321 tests):
                    Microsoft Graph transcript capture with a net-new app-only
                    auth path, AI summarization, and CRM-aware LLM routing to
                    Teams Adaptive Cards — durable workflows proven crash-safe.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Primary engineer of Cuddy Brain, a Teams-embedded ops hub
                    mirroring 10 SaaS systems into PostgreSQL (~115 tables) —
                    ~3,860 commits, ~69% of backend history (NestJS, BullMQ/Redis,
                    React, Azure OpenAI).
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Shipped AI call intelligence: call → transcription → Azure
                    OpenAI summary → extracted follow-up tasks → Teams Adaptive
                    Card, minutes after hang-up, with single-flight locking and
                    crash recovery.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Built AI monitoring (obituary adjudication with deterministic
                    post-gates; address-change detection over public records and
                    client comms) and co-built a LangGraph agent compiling client
                    reviews from 7 systems.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Hardened the platform: shared Azure OpenAI client (timeouts,
                    retries, usage tracking), HMAC webhook verification,
                    secret-scanning CI, caching and N+1 performance overhauls.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Sole developer of L'OR UNLIMITED REMIX (JDE × HLWN 2026), an
                    AI brand app + event kiosk: Gemini with deterministic
                    fallback, on-device CLIP vision, 60fps WebGL fluid engine,
                    offline-first PWA, Bluetooth thermal printing — 129/129
                    commits, ~24.6k LOC, 11 weeks to production.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Built Cuddy Scanner, a .NET 9/WPF TWAIN document scanner
                    (barcode batch separation, PDF assembly, SharePoint filing) in
                    daily production use.
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div class="role-entry compact-entry">
                <h3>
                  <strong>Freelance</strong> — Software Developer · 2023 → 2024
                </h3>
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    Children's game app (React Native, Expo, Redux) and
                    cross-platform travel planner (RN + MobX; Express/MongoDB
                    backend; React admin).
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div class="role-entry compact-entry">
                <h3><strong>SolvR</strong> — Software Developer · 2023</h3>
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    Refactored and shipped a cross-platform chat app (React Native,
                    Expo, MobX, Firebase): real-time messaging, secure auth, state
                    architecture.
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>

              <div class="role-entry compact-entry">
                <h3>
                  <strong>Tynass IT</strong> — Software Developer · 2019 → 2022
                </h3>
                <ul>
                  <li>
                    Delivered AR tourism app, job-seeker platform, fashion
                    e-commerce and corporate sites (React, Material-UI, Express,
                    MongoDB).
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </section>
          </div>

          <aside class="resume-side" aria-label="Skills and additional details">
            <section aria-labelledby="skills-title">
              <h2 id="skills-title">SKILLS</h2>
              <p>
                TypeScript · React/Next.js · React Native · NestJS/Node · PostgreSQL
                · Redis/BullMQ · Azure OpenAI · Gemini · LangGraph · RAG (pgvector)
                · transformers.js · C#/.NET 9 · WPF · C++20/JUCE · Microsoft Graph
                &amp; Teams · Salesforce · Docker · GitHub Actions · Vercel
              </p>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="projects-title">
              <h2 id="projects-title">SELECTED SIDE PROJECTS</h2>
              <ul>
                <li>
                  HyperMesh DSP &amp; HyperGpu (C++20/JUCE): LAN mesh for
                  real-time DSP offload and a GPU-accelerated plugin host; CI
                  builds for 5 platforms.
                </li>
                <li>
                  Assurances BIAT KB: explainable RAG chatbot (NestJS, pgvector,
                  Ollama) with cited answers and RBAC audit trail.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="education-title">
              <h2 id="education-title">EDUCATION</h2>
              <p>
                B.A. Multimedia Communication, Higher Institute of Multimedia
                Arts of Manouba (ISAMM), 2019
              </p>
            </section>

            <section aria-labelledby="languages-title">
              <h2 id="languages-title">LANGUAGES</h2>
              <p class="languages">
                Arabic (native) · English (professional) · French (A2–B1) ·
                Italian (A2)
              </p>
            </section>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </article>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 14mm;
  }

  :global(html) {
    background: var(--paper, #f2f1ec);
  }

  :global(body) {
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink, #0e0e12);
    background: var(--paper, #f2f1ec);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
  }

  .resume-skip {
    position: fixed;
    z-index: 10;
    top: 0.75rem;
    left: 0.75rem;
    transform: translateY(-180%);
    padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;
    color: var(--paper, #f2f1ec);
    background: var(--cobalt, #2418f2);
  }

  .resume-skip:focus {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .resume-shell {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 3.5rem) clamp(1.25rem, 4vw, 4rem);
    overflow-x: clip;
  }

  .resume-actions {
    display: flex;
    width: min(210mm, 100%);
    margin: 0 auto 1rem;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .resume-actions a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    min-height: 2.75rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .resume-actions a:focus-visible {
    outline: 3px solid var(--cobalt, #2418f2);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  .back-link {
    padding: 0.65rem 0.25rem;
    color: var(--cobalt, #2418f2);
  }

  .download-link {
    padding: 0.65rem 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink, #0e0e12);
    background: var(--signal, #ff4d1f);
  }

  .resume-sheet {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    width: min(210mm, 100%);
    min-height: 297mm;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 14mm;
    color: var(--ink, #0e0e12);
    background: var(--paper, #f2f1ec);
    box-shadow: 0 1.25rem 4rem rgb(14 14 18 / 14%);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    line-height: 1.34;
  }

  .resume-header {
    padding-bottom: 4mm;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--cobalt, #2418f2);
  }

  .identity-line {
    display: flex;
    min-width: 0;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  h3,
  p,
  ul {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-variation-settings:
      "wdth" 88,
      "wght" 750;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .role {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 0.86rem;
    font-variation-settings:
      "wdth" 94,
      "wght" 580;
    line-height: 1.1;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .contact-line {
    margin: 2.4mm 0 0;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.63rem;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .contact-line a {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration-color: var(--cobalt, #2418f2);
    text-underline-offset: 0.12em;
  }

  .resume-body {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 68fr) minmax(0, 32fr);
    gap: 6mm;
    padding-top: 4mm;
  }

  .resume-main,
  .resume-side {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  section {
    break-inside: avoid;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1.7mm;
    padding-bottom: 0.8mm;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--cobalt, #2418f2);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .summary-section p {
    margin-bottom: 3.5mm;
  }

  h3 {
    margin-bottom: 0.7mm;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    line-height: 1.22;
  }

  h3 strong {
    font-weight: 750;
  }

  p {
    margin-bottom: 2.3mm;
  }

  .role-entry {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin-bottom: 2.2mm;
  }

  .role-context {
    margin-bottom: 1.2mm;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  ul {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1em;
  }

  li {
    margin-bottom: 0.9mm;
    padding-left: 0.15em;
  }

  li::marker {
    color: var(--cobalt, #2418f2);
  }

  .compact-entry {
    margin-bottom: 1.8mm;
  }

  .compact-entry li {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .resume-side {
    padding-left: 5mm;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--cobalt-2, #4e45ff);
  }

  .resume-side section {
    margin-bottom: 4.5mm;
  }

  .resume-side p,
  .resume-side li {
    margin-bottom: 1.8mm;
  }

  .languages {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .resume-shell {
      padding: 1rem;
    }

    .resume-actions {
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    .resume-sheet {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: clamp(1.25rem, 5vw, 2rem);
      font-size: 0.83rem;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .identity-line {
      display: block;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 8vw, 2.4rem);
    }

    .role {
      margin-top: 0.55rem;
      white-space: normal;
    }

    .contact-line {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.35rem;
      font-size: 0.66rem;
      overflow-wrap: anywhere;
    }

    .resume-body {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .resume-side {
      padding-left: 0;
      border-left: 0;
    }
  }

  @media print {
    :global(html),
    :global(body) {
      width: 210mm;
      min-width: 210mm;
      height: 297mm;
      background: var(--paper, #f2f1ec);
      -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
      print-color-adjust: exact;
    }

    .resume-skip,
    .resume-actions {
      display: none;
    }

    .resume-shell {
      width: auto;
      min-height: 0;
      padding: 0;
      overflow: visible;
    }

    .resume-sheet {
      width: auto;
      min-height: 0;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-shadow: none;
      font-size: 9.6pt;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .resume-header {
      padding-bottom: 3mm;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 18pt;
    }

    .role {
      font-size: 9.5pt;
    }

    .contact-line {
      margin-top: 2.2mm;
      font-size: 7.6pt;
    }

    .resume-body {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 68fr) minmax(0, 32fr);
      gap: 5mm;
      padding-top: 3mm;
    }

    h2 {
      margin-bottom: 1.6mm;
      padding-bottom: 0.8mm;
      font-size: 7.8pt;
    }

    .summary-section p {
      margin-bottom: 2.5mm;
    }

    h3 {
      margin-bottom: 0.7mm;
      font-size: 9.9pt;
    }

    p {
      margin-bottom: 1.55mm;
    }

    .role-entry {
      margin-bottom: 2.2mm;
    }

    .role-context {
      margin-bottom: 0.75mm;
    }

    li {
      margin-bottom: 1.2mm;
    }

    .compact-entry {
      margin-bottom: 1.05mm;
    }

    .resume-side {
      padding-left: 3.5mm;
    }

    .resume-side section {
      margin-bottom: 4.5mm;
    }

    .resume-side p,
    .resume-side li {
      margin-bottom: 1.15mm;
    }

    a,
    a:visited {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    a[href]::after {
      content: none;
    }
  }
</style>
